{"sourceUrl":"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:24.992142+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span> 中国科学技术大学公共管理学院</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>级推免生预面试报名工作即日起正式开始。为方便考生提前准备，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>一、报名单位</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 中国科学技术大学公共管理学院，学院代码：</span></span><span><span><span><span>216</span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>二、网上报名</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 请登录中国科学技术大学研究生报考服务系统</span></span><span><span><span><span>https://xspt.ustc.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span><span><span>，进入“推免生预报名”，选择中国科学技术大学公共管理学院，学院代码：</span></span><span><span><span><span>216</span></span></span></span><span><span>，按照报名要求填写信息和上传相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 网上报名时间：</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>日至</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>15</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>三、面试时间及地点</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span> 初步拟定于</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>20</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>日、</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>21</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><span>，线下举行。具体时间安排及详细流程将通过邮件通知，请考生密切关注。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 以上安排如有变动，另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>四、招生专业</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>120400</span></span></span></span><span><span>公共管理</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>035400</span></span></span></span><span><span>知识产权</span></span></p><p><span><span> 注： 学院将对申请人进行资格审核，拟参加面试名单通过系统进行公布，未入选者不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>五、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>、热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>届优秀本科毕业生；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span>、学业成绩优异，具备扎实的管理学、经济学、法学等相关学科基础；科研兴趣浓厚，具备较强的学术研究潜力与综合研究能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span>、能够取得就读学校推荐免试研究生资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>六、提交材料</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>、网报时所有信息务必详细准确填写，请自觉保证提供材料的真实性，学院将会对材料进行复核。（</span></span><span><span><strong>材料如有不实将取消相关资格</strong></span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span>、材料提交：</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>）身份证（正反面扫描至一页）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span>）学生证（含个人信息页和学期注册页）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span>）个人简历（限一页</span></span><span><span><span><span>pdf</span></span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span>）前两年半成绩单（加盖学校教务部门公章）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span>）总评成绩排名证明（加盖学校教务部门或所在院系公章）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span>）英语水平证明（四六级</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span>托福</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span>雅思等）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>）竞赛获奖及证明（若有）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span>）科研成果及证明（若有）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>）专业资格证书（若有）</span></span></p><p><span><span> （</span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span>）其他荣誉及证明（若有）</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>将以上所有申请材料（含各种证明材料）按线上提交顺序汇总至一个</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>文件，命名方式为姓名</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>+</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>本科学校</strong></span></span><span><span>，上传到报名系统的</span></span><span><span><strong>“个人所有资料汇总</strong></span></span><span><span>”处，否则将视为材料不完整。报名阶段不需邮寄纸质材料。请务必保证材料的真实性，如发现材料不实将取消录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>七、材料审核及遴选</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span> 学院将根据所提交的材料进行审核，并择优遴选。面试名单将在研究生报考服务系统上公布并通过系统短信通知；未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sppm.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0910/c13414a752826/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><strong>八、联系方式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 咨询电话（限工作日时间段）：宋老师，魏老师</span></span><span><span><span><span>0551-63607760</span></span></span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:gradsppm@ustc.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gradsppm@ustc.edu.cn</a></span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e66ce1335377b6ed2764cd5f611bc49ddb7ecfe6baeba237b97e5f7b52486cb9","textLength":985,"sourceSha256":"ab35d198fda8c98e913eece231cf9135f1bd55fb6cfa75e416ee56dcfeeb9bbc","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-49d534b2ba8dd5079af7","title":"2026年中国科学技术大学公共管理学院关于接收2027级推免生预面试报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:24.992142+00:00"}
